      "structure_description": "A nonlinear four-Sm(III) array of distorted seven-coordinate pentagonal bipyramids. Three μ2-SPh ligands link each exterior ion to an interior ion, and two μ2-SPh ligands link the interior pair. The exterior ions also bear terminal thiolates. The crystal contains two lattice diethyl ether molecules per Sm4 unit.",
